before:
Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
function numbers(): Generator {
    echo "start\n";
    yield 1;
    echo "next\n";
    yield 2;
}
$numbers = numbers();
echo "created\n";
foreach ($numbers as $number) { echo $number, "\n"; break; }
```

